---
description: Personal Knowledge MCP engineering rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read AGENTS.md and docs/TOOLS.md before changing a tool.
- Preserve the five public tool names and backward-compatible fields.
- Execute tools through MCP Client in Agent code.
- Never bypass resolve_inside or expose absolute filesystem access.
- Classify failures before retrying; retry only timeout/transient and only when idempotent.
- Keep secrets out of source, responses, SQLite traces, fixtures, and logs.
- Run Ruff, pytest, generated-doc check, and local eval after backend changes.
